<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0C9B06025" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Roof Panel Removal and Installation
</title>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0137.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "84.698mm" ver = "01" gw = "332" gh = "224"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06025001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove roof panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0B9B0011.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "117.337mm" ver = "01" gw = "509" gh = "316"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.394in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "6.693in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
If equipped
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
<symbol name = "MANOTE" width = "5.132mm" height = "3.048mm"/>
:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
When heating around sealer application portion to detach body sealer, be sure that temperature of said portion does not reach 170 &#176;C (338 &#176;F).
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06025002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s).
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Rearend door: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Windshield: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct tack welding to roof panel center No.1 member, roof panel center No.2 member, roof panel center No.3 member, roof panel center No.4 member and roof panel center No.5 member.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply body sealer.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0B9B0012.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "117.337mm" ver = "01" gw = "468" gh = "316"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
If equipped
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
1.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Applied part of body sealer
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install roof panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld and plug weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0B9B0013.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "117.337mm" ver = "01" gw = "505" gh = "316"/>
